    Bug 2014954 - Another try to fix intermittent comm/mailnews/imap/test/unit/test_dontStatNoSelect.js | Test timed out. r=vineet


    Close connections before resetting the test and avoid peformTest() during the test teardown.
    From logs it looks like a new login is tried at teardown causing infinite wait.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D295798

